          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>In a time when online shopping is part of everyday life, product returns have become increasingly common, and increasingly costly for both companies and the environment, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>especially in the fashion retail sector.</run>
