            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' italic='true'>SQL schema: purchases table linked to brands, categories and collections through foreign keys</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='56889' id='69' type-v2='text' w='47000' x='9250' y='22333'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='15'>THE DATASET</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Source: Kaggle, Retail Fashion Boutique dataset</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>           2,176 synthetic purchases</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>           15 variables: product, brand, collection, price, discount, rating and more</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='15'>PROJECT PIPELINE</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Step 1 | Python:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> data collection + cleaning and EDA</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Step 2 | Python + SQL:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> design the relational schema and load the clean data into MySQL</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Step 3 | SQL:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>  analytical queries to answer business questions</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Step 4 | Python:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> statistical analysis to test SQL results</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Step 5 | Tableau: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>final dashboard and storytelling</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='4000' id='70' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/prana/OneDrive/Área de Trabalho/botao_1024_VF.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='2250' x='9375' y='35333' />
